never selected the standard scheme — it left the DEFAULT, quadratic since 2026-09-21. The call is
now unconditional. The 16 configurations are 16 distinct runs again; before the repair they were
8 runs printed twice, which is why the cf=0 and cf=1 rows of the Gate S table above agree to five
